# PARTNER FIX: Every strategy gets its OWN grid ranges tailored to its logic.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SENSITIVITY_STRATEGY_CONFIG — Per-strategy prematch grids (v74.2)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Each strategy gets the CORRECT prematch column based on WHO it bets on:
#   - Fav-based (14 st) → prematch_fav_odds  le  [1.1, 1.3, 1.5, 1.8, 2.2, 2.8, 3.5, 5.0, 10.0, 999.0]
