#  [v76_41] Families are grouped by SPORT and by what the conditions DO, not by
#  name. Two strategies on the same market that read different signals belong in
#  different families, because the odds band that suits a comeback read is not
#  the band that suits a mispricing read. Each family carries its own min_odds
