#  and float-precision defects were fixed). The v43 fire functions are RETAINED above, unmodified,
#  so the lineage check can still see them and so the equivalence test remains runnable.
# NOTE (v52): SPORT_WIRING is the source of truth for frame paths; this dict is kept in sync
