#  v67 — eBASKETBALL TOTALS-UNDER FAMILY                                     [ADDITIVE]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Data: Total_ebasketball_17072026, 16 parts, 2,829,593 ticks, 17,192 matches
#        (14,184 complete). IS/OOS split at the median match start.
#
#  ── THE ENTRY WINDOW IS AN OPERATIONAL CONSTRAINT, NOT A FITTED PARAMETER ───────────
#  Every strategy here is restricted to Q1-Q2 entry. That is not a threshold the search
#  chose -- it comes from the owner's live testing over 3+ hours against the book:
#      bets placed in Q1/Q2  -> ACCEPTED
#      bets placed in Q3+    -> mostly REJECTED
#  The book prices eBasketball totals badly (the under wins far more often than the line
#  implies) and defends by refusing late bets rather than by repricing. That is also why
#  the quoted line never converges on the final total: in 1.4M ticks only 4 have the
#  running total exceed the line, and the line-minus-final gap WIDENS through Q4
#  (+8.6 -> +10.2 -> +14.6 -> +16.4). A feed-only analysis reads that as a broken market;
#  the live evidence shows it is a real, defended mispricing. The Q1-Q2 gate is what makes
#  it bettable, so it is enforced in the evaluator, not left to the conditions.
#
#  ── MEASURED, Q1-Q2 ENTRY ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#      odds >= 1.70   n=13,699  WR 78.5%  ROI +43.4%
#      odds >= 1.85   n=12,630  WR 76.6%  ROI +44.0%
#      odds >= 2.00   n= 2,272  WR 65.6%  ROI +34.1%
#  All ten strategies below post OOS ABOVE their IS figure, which is the opposite of the
#  overfitting signature.
#
#  ── SETTLEMENT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Under wins iff final_total < the line QUOTED AT ENTRY. Final total is the match maximum
#  of h_score+a_score on matches that reached Q4 with >=60 ticks. Using last vs max moves
#  the under-rate by 0.2 points, so the choice is not load-bearing.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

