# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  v67 — u_jump WHITELIST VARIANTS  +  HIGH-ODDS COMEBACK FRONTIER          [ADDITIVE]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ── PART A: u_jump ON THE WHITELIST UNDERS ──────────────────────────────────────────
#  u_jump was FIRST tested additively and improved 0 of 10 whitelist strategies -- the
#  information was already carried by u_rank / u_drift / u_flat. It only pays as a SWAP or
#  as a COMPLEMENT, and the swap test found 3 of 10:
#      Late_Cheap_NearLine     u_rank<=0.7  -> u_jump<=1.00   80.9% -> 82.8% WR
#      Late_Cheap_PoissonEdge  u_rank<=0.7  -> u_jump<=1.00   79.2% -> 81.7% WR
#      Late_PriceSteady        u_drift<=0.0 -> u_jump<=1.00   79.0% -> 79.4% WR
#  Keeping BOTH terms beat swapping on PriceSteady: 80.7% WR / +68.7% ROI on 451 of 475
#  bets. u_drift is an ABSOLUTE price change, u_jump a PROPORTIONAL one -- on a 1.90 under
#  a 0.05 drift is 2.6%, on a 3.50 under it is 1.4%. The ratio normalises across price
#  levels, which is why they combine rather than duplicate.
#
#  RANKING ON WIN RATE HID THE BEST ENTRY. NearLine at u_jump<=1.40 wins only 74.1% but
#  takes 2,870 bets for +928u -- SEVEN TIMES the base's +120u. Rank on P&L as well as rate.
#
#  ── PART B: THE HIGH-ODDS COMEBACK FRONTIER ─────────────────────────────────────────
#  Market = back the TRAILING side to win outright, GT Leagues + Adriatic only, odds >= 12.
#  Base at odds>=12 is 6.5% WR / +25.1% ROI; these lift it to 19.4-20.8% at +279% to +380%.
#
#  WHY ODDS >= 12 AND NOT LOWER. Every band below 8.0 is roughly -21% ROI no matter what
#  conditions are stacked on it; the book prices recoverable positions correctly. The
#  mispricing lives ONLY in the long tail. A 21.5% strike at 12.12 odds returns +127.9%
#  while a 20.8% strike at 24.00 returns +379.9% -- the same win rate at double the price
#  is triple the return. Optimise the PRICE, not the strike.
#
#  RISK SHAPE. 6-8 losers per winner, max win streak 2-3, drawdowns 10-20u. This is a
#  different instrument from the unders and must be staked as one -- small flat stakes,
#  and the tolerance to sit through 30+ bet droughts.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

