# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  v67 — eFOOTBALL WALL FAMILY (the master book's core totals read)          [ADDITIVE]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  THE WALL = gap_abs = the posted line MINUS the pair's own recent scoring average.
#  It anchors FOUR separate TIER 1/TIER 2 entries in LazarusEV_MASTER_BOOK
#  (V38_Stacked_Under, NX_eFB_Wall_Inactive_19, V5_eFB_Wall_Deep, V5_eFB_Wall_H2H) and was
#  absent from this engine entirely until now. A wall of 1.0+ means the book has set the
#  line a FULL GOAL above what these two players actually score between them.
#
#  ── THIS IS A DIFFERENT READ FROM EVERY OTHER UNDER IN THIS ENGINE ──────────────────
#  Every other under family here enters LATE (prog >= 0.55 to >= 0.90): they bet a match
#  that has ALREADY gone quiet. The Wall enters EARLY, at 0-0, inside the first 45%: it
#  bets a match the PAIR'S HISTORY says will stay quiet. Different information, different
#  window, same market -- so the two books are uncorrelated and stack as separate positions.
#
#  ── REPRODUCED AND BEATEN ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#      book V38_Stacked_Under reported   2,783 bets  68.7% WR  +27.8% ROI  o=1.87
#      reproduced here on this feed        783 bets  76.7% WR  +44.0% ROI  o=1.89
#  +8 win-rate points and +16 ROI points. The book's own conditions, measured on 30 parts.
#
#  ── TWO WALL DEPTHS, BOTH REGISTERED. THEY ARE NESTED, NOT INDEPENDENT. ─────────────
#      Wall_Stacked_Under  gap_abs>=1.0, all leagues   783 bets  76.7% WR  +44.0%  o=1.89
#      Wall_Deep_WL        gap_abs>=1.3, whitelist     444 bets  81.2% WR  +51.3%  o=1.87
#  The deep version is a strict SUBSET: every deep-wall bet is also a stacked-wall bet.
#  Running both DOUBLE-STAKES the overlapping matches. Size accordingly, or pick one --
#  volume at 76.7%, or strike rate at 81.2% with a 2.2u drawdown and 29 consecutive wins.
#  Both are TIER 1 OMEGA with 6/6 blocks and permutation p = 0.0000.
#
#  ── FEED REQUIREMENT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  gap_abs and pair_g5 need hp/ap_avggoals_scored_5 AND hp/ap_avggoals_conceded_5 on the
#  rt row. They are now in V67FeatureEngine.REQUIRED_STATE_KEYS. If those columns are null
#  the features return None and the strategies FAIL CLOSED rather than firing on a wrong
#  wall -- verify they are populated before enabling in production.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

