# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  v67 — CACHED-FRAME VALIDATION: THE PARQUET PROBLEM, SOLVED PROPERLY       [ADDITIVE]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  WHY CACHED FRAMES KEPT PRODUCING UNDEPLOYABLE STRATEGIES
#  Every measurement in this project runs against a cached frame. Three separate defects all
#  came from the SAME root cause -- the cache computed a feature DIFFERENTLY from the engine:
#
#   1. u_flat. The cache filled it from the whole-match price series, so a value existed at
#      every tick. The live engine fills it from 40 OBSERVED price changes, and inside the
#      p<=0.45 entry window the median match has FOUR. Cache said 3,847 qualifying matches;
#      live said 8. The strategy was measured on a feature that cannot exist at entry.
#   2. u_jump. The cache anchored on the first row of the FILTERED frame; the engine anchors
#      on the first tick of the RAW stream. Different denominator, off-by-one-bet parity.
#   3. gap_abs. The cache stored float32 and computed in float32 (3.0+2.2+2.4+1.4)/2 = 4.5
#      exactly; the engine computes in float64 and gets 4.500000059604645. On a line of 5.5
#      the cache says gap_abs = 1.0 and the engine says 0.9999999403953552. A condition of
#      `gap_abs >= 1.0` is TRUE in one and FALSE in the other -- unless BOTH sides compare
#      through v67_cond_mask/_V67_OPS, which carry V67_ODDS_EPS and absorb it.
#
#  THE RULE THAT PREVENTS ALL THREE
#  A cached frame is a CACHE OF ENGINE OUTPUT, never an independent re-derivation. Build it
#  by running the live feature engine, or validate it against the engine before use.
#  laz_validate_cached_frame() does the validation; it is cheap and it is not optional.
#
#  AND: every comparison must go through v67_cond_mask(). A hand-rolled `frame[col] >= x`
#  skips V67_ODDS_EPS and will disagree with the live evaluator on threshold-exact rows.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════



