#  v67 — eBASKETBALL HIGH-ODDS WALL FAMILY                                   [ADDITIVE]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  THE STACK, MEASURED AT EVERY STEP (2,003 matches, Q1-Q2 entry)
#
#    floor   BASE (under)        + WALL (wall_min>=10)   + WHITELIST
#    1.70    76.1% +20.8 +37.7%  80.9% +25.4 +45.9%      91.6% +35.8 +64.4%
#    1.80    72.9% +19.5 +36.9%  77.7% +24.3 +45.8%      90.3% +37.2 +70.4%
