#    Blowout_Fav  123  74.6%  +46.9%        103  78.9%  +55.7%   (+4.3 WR)
#    Blowout_Dog  103  69.4%  +35.4%        122  64.4%  +25.5%   (+19 bets, -5.0 WR)
#    Mid_Fav      170  65.6%  +30.2%        164  77.0%  +53.1%   (+11.4 WR)
#    Mid_Dog      119  63.5%  +25.0%        152  79.3%  +55.5%   (+33 bets, +15.8 WR, DD 4.2->2.0u)
#    Close_Fav    308  63.4%  +23.7%        463  66.3%  +30.0%   (+155 bets, +2.9 WR)
#    Close_Dog    178  61.9%  +21.4%        197  69.2%  +36.2%   (+19 bets, +7.3 WR)
#
#  The old set had 203 OVERLAPS across 1,001 bets (20%) because a match could be 2-4 apart
#  in Q1 and 4-6 apart in Q2. Dropping the quarter split removes the overlap AND adds volume.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

