#      remove fav <= 0       ->  75.9%   (-2.7)
#      remove lead_net >= 0  ->  68.2%  (-10.4)   <-- lead_net CARRIES THE EDGE
#      seg_wins 2 -> 1       ->  51.3%  (-27.3)   <-- registered as a NEGATIVE CONTROL
#
#  DIRECT PERMUTATION, 1,000 draws per chain from the same qualifying universe:
#      null median -8.3% ROI | null p95 +2.9% | real +57.4% | p = 0.0000 on all eleven.
#  The stepwise SEARCH that surfaced this chain could NOT beat its own null (250 noise
#  stacks vs 250 real, best noise +98.4%). The CHAIN beats a direct null outright. The
#  search was a way of looking; the finding stands on its own test.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

