#      2b       -0.36/-0.5%    +1.47/+2.6%    +3.64/+7.9%
#  POSITIVE IN EVERY WINDOW at 2.0+, and STRENGTHENING as the match runs on.
#
#  The nine legacy entries all sat at 1.75-2.00 floors -- the wrong prices. The edge is at
#  2.00 and above. Only ELEVEN stacks cleared the owner bar here, against thousands on the
#  trailing side: the leader is usually priced correctly and the exceptions are narrow.
