# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  v68 — REAL FOOTBALL: TOTAL GOALS OVER                                   [ADDITIVE]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  THE INVERSE OF THE UNDER BOOK ON THE SAME AXIS: under uses ht_tot <= 0 (goalless first
#  half), over uses ht_tot >= 2 (two or more before the break). Same feature, opposite read.
#
#  BANNING THE HALF-TIME FEATURES returns ZERO stacks at 80%, 75%, 68% AND 60%. Tested, not
#  assumed. On both sides of this market the half-time score is the only axis that reaches
#  these rates.
#
#  pace <= 2 IS THE NEW FEATURE (five of eight, not half-time based): the match scored twice
#  before the break but has since gone quiet. The book holds the total high because the
#  goals already came.
#
#  UNCONDITIONED OVER IS THE WORST BASE IN THE ENGINE: 43.8% at 1.84 for -22.2%, negative in
#  EVERY band (edge -10.8 to -14.8). 511 conditioned stacks still clear the owner bar.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

