# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  CAUSALITY BY DEFAULT — a feature is illegal until proven legal                [v75_13]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  THE HOLE THIS CLOSES. laz_discovery_causal_ok was a DENY-LIST: it rejected names it had
#  been told about (LAZ_NEVER_AT_ENTRY, BB66_RESOLVES_AT) and passed everything else. That
#  is exactly backwards for a loop that invents new features. Every one of these slipped
#  through unchallenged:
#      fb_prog / fb_trail_by      -- added hours ago, never listed
#      laz_fav_trailing           -- added minutes ago, never listed
#      seg_wins with q <= 1       -- counts segments that have not happened yet
#      lead_net with q <= 1       -- a 20-tick net that does not exist at tick 3
#      fb_cb_prog with half <= 1  -- progress since a deficit, read before the deficit
#  A deny-list can only ever be as current as the last person who remembered to update it.
#  An LLM proposing features around the clock will outrun that within a day.
#
#  THE INVERSION. A feature is NOT ELIGIBLE FOR ANY SEARCH unless it carries a lineage
#  record whose `window_semantics` says it is readable at the tick it is evaluated on:
#      'row'      computed from THIS tick alone            -> always legal
#      'observed' running stats over ticks ALREADY SEEN    -> always legal
#      'anchor'   latched at or before the first tick      -> always legal
#      'phase'    resolves when a named phase completes    -> legal from that phase on
#      anything else, or NO LINEAGE AT ALL                 -> REJECTED
#
#  This means a newly invented feature CANNOT be searched until its author has written down
#  when it becomes readable. That is the point: the cost of adding a feature now includes
#  stating its causality, and a feature nobody has classified cannot silently produce a
#  strategy that fires in the book and never in production.
#
#  It fails CLOSED. An unclassified name is rejected, not waved through. The three
#  fabricated basketball stacks (BBT03/04/06, reported at +58% to +71% ROI) and the forty
#  deleted football strategies (+53% ROI on no edge) were both this failure mode, caught
#  only after they had been registered and reported.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Semantics that are safe at every tick, by construction.
_LAZ_LINEAGE_ALL = {}
try:
    _LAZ_LINEAGE_ALL.update(V67_FEATURE_LINEAGE_FULL)
except Exception:
    pass
try:
    _LAZ_LINEAGE_ALL.update(V67_TEN_FEATURE_LINEAGE)
except Exception:
    pass


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  WINDOW SEMANTICS BACKFILL — classify every feature the registry actually uses [v75_13]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  The allow-list gate reads `window_semantics` off each feature's lineage record. Most
#  records predate that field, so without this backfill the gate would reject the entire
#  working book -- need_frac, ml_spread, seg_wins and the rest -- as unclassified.
#
#  Each class is a CLAIM ABOUT WHEN THE VALUE EXISTS, and the claim is what the gate
#  enforces:
#      'row'      derived from this tick alone: scores, prices, phase, ratios of them
#      'observed' running statistics over ticks ALREADY SEEN: cummin, cummax, shift(k),
#                 rolling velocities. Safe because the window looks backwards only.
#      'anchor'   latched at or before the first tick: pre-match prices, opening lines,
#                 the favourite role. Fixed before play, so legal at every tick.
#      'phase'    resolves when a named phase completes -- handled by BB66_RESOLVES_AT,
#                 not here.
#
#  A feature absent from BOTH this map and the lineage records stays REJECTED. That is the
#  cost of adding a feature: state when it becomes readable, or it cannot be searched.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

