#  Every key that can appear on the left-hand side of a discovered condition.
#  'rt' names the rt_efootball_betting_conditions column(s) the value is built
#  from; 'live' is the exact expression in LazarusFeatureEngine.compute();
#  'engine' is the generator line the live port was verified against.
#
#  A strategy is deployable if and only if EVERY feature in its conditions has
#  an entry here whose 'rt' columns all exist. That is a mechanical check —
#  see assert_deployable() below — not a judgement call.

