#
# THE WORKBOOK A RUN WRITES IS NOT THE BOOK. LAZARUS_<SPORT>_MODE<N>_*.xlsx
# holds ONLY what that run found. If a run reports 9 legs where the last one
# reported 179, nothing was lost — the register suppressed the 170 the engine
