# embedded book is smaller than the previous one.
#
# --reset-book clears the SUPPRESSION so the engine searches from scratch. It
# does NOT delete anything. Use it when you want the full search again.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 # ── WHERE THE DATA IS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 # The engine uses an ASSIGNED parquet if it exists in the folder and SKIPS
 # the csv_* rebuild entirely. The rebuild is a fallback for a missing file,
 # never a step that runs anyway.
   # ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   # WHERE THE DATA IS. Set these and nothing else needs to know.
   #
   # THE ORDER THE ENGINE FOLLOWS, every run, before any mode is chosen:
   #   1  look for AB_<sport>.parquet in parquet_dir
   #   2  if absent, look in the other search paths below
