   # Additional places to look before giving up and rebuilding. Order matters.
   # Where raw CSV lives when a parquet has to be built.
 # ── THE ASSIGNED PARQUET FILES ───────────────────────────────────────────
 # key            : the sport as the engine refers to it
 # parquet        : the file to USE if present (relative to parquet_dir)
