 #   --mode 3   rung search: the ladder, seeds, manufacturing, the cascade (default)
 #   --mode 5   exploration with the brain
 #
 # COMBINA IS NOT A MODE. It is the PHASE that stacks the strategies a search
 # found into slips. Only Mode 3 is wired to it. So a Mode 3 run has two
 # halves, and the FLAGS pick which half you get:
