# LAZ_BRAIN MODULE: laz_recovered
# §laz_recovered   <- grep this anchor to land here
# OBJECTIVE : EVERY STRATEGY THAT HAS EVER EXISTED, ARMABLE
# PURPOSE   : 3,130 strategies with full condition stacks reachable by Mode 1, Mode 3 and Mode 5.
# HOW       : 2,311 from dict-shaped containers the registry never walked plus the v105 master index · 683 parsed out of the Trigger_Conditions and Discovered_Strategies sheets of MASTER_BOOK.xlsx and _v10 · 136 from Lazarus_EFB_Strategies.py, the live production book whose condition strings are byte-identical to MASTER_BOOK over 273,458 verified bets. Each enters as a SEED MASK: it names a population that once worked and the search re-derives the chain inside it against the current gate.
# VALUE     : On tabletennis 6 of 9 strategies came from recovered seeds. The recorded numbers travel with each stack and are never trusted — two settlement defects surfaced this session.
# IF SKIPPED: Two thirds of the book is unreachable and gets rediscovered by accident or not at all.
# ==========================================================================
"""laz_recovered.py — THE 538 RECOVERED STRATEGIES, wired in.

WHERE THEY WERE

Hidden in dict-shaped containers the registry never walked:

    DISCOVERED_STRATEGIES    429   {sport: [strategy, ...]}
    NEW_INVERSE_STRATEGIES    69
    V67_TEN_STRATEGIES        16
    QUARTER_LEAD_STRATEGIES   15
    LEAD1_LONG_STRATEGIES      9

A scan looking for module-level LISTS of strategy dicts sees
DISCOVERED_STRATEGIES as an object of length 5 — five sport keys — and moves
on. They were recovered by executing the literals in dependency order, three
passes, so containers referencing other containers resolve.

Each carries its full condition stack plus the numbers it was recorded with:
n, win rate, odds, ROI, CI, permutation p, drawdown.

LOOKAHEAD — 32 OF THEM ARE FLAGGED, NOT SILENTLY ARMED

The condition library self-reports `resolves_at`. Terms q1_lead, q1_margin,
q1_tot, q1_total and the manufactured X_q1_* interactions resolve at 0.25 —
they are NOT known until the first quarter ends. A strategy conditioning on
them before that is reading the future. This is the same defect that had 40
football strategies purged for half-time lookahead, on a different clock.

Those 32 are registered with `lookahead_risk` set and `armable_before_q1`
False. laz_lookahead still gates them at run time; this makes the risk visible
at REGISTRY time rather than only when a bet is graded.
"""
