"""laz_promote.py — MANUFACTURED CONDITIONS THAT EARNED THEIR PLACE ARE KEPT.

THE PROBLEM

materialise() builds conditions in memory. The process exits and they are gone.
The next run manufactures from scratch, and because manufacturing depends on
which pairs happen to be super-additive on that pass, it may build different
ones. A validated strategy naming ix2_ixmino_o_ixelapm is then unrebuildable —
exactly the failure that had recovered stacks blocked on
X_X_u_pace__minus__u_time_in_lead__x__X_u_elapsed__minus__u_time_in_lead, and
exactly what cost two days of recovering conditions from transcripts.

WHAT THIS DOES

After a run, every manufactured condition appearing in an ACCEPTED strategy is
written to laz_promoted.json with its full definition: both parents, the
operator, the executable arithmetic, its lineage to primitives, and its
inherited resolution time. The build embeds that file, so the next engine
carries them as first-class conditions — available in the base pool and as
parents for further manufacturing.

The pool compounds instead of resetting.

ONLY WHAT EARNED IT

A rung manufactures ~459 conditions and a handful reach an accepted strategy.
Promoting all of them would add thousands of unused terms per run. Only those
actually named in a chain that passed the gate are kept.

THE CAUSALITY CHECK IS NOT OPTIONAL

A promoted condition becomes a permanent, first-class term that future runs
treat as a primitive. If a forward-looking quantity is promoted once, it is in
the engine for good and every later strategy built on it is silently wrong.

So every candidate is re-checked here, independently of the checks it already
passed:

  1  neither parent, at ANY depth, may be a settlement column
  2  resolves_at is the LATER of its two parents — inherited, never assumed 0
  3  a term whose lineage cannot be resolved to primitives is REFUSED, because
     an unverifiable ancestry cannot be declared safe
  4  a cycle in the parentage is a REFUSAL, not a default — laz_lookahead's
     cycle guard returns 0.0 to avoid a crash, and 0.0 here would mean
     "knowable at every tick", which is the dangerous direction to guess in

Every refusal is logged with its reason. A promoted term carries the audit.
"""
