# OBJECTIVE : EVERY MODE WORKBOOK
# PURPOSE   : strategy_book (1/5), validation_book (2), bases_book (4), portfolio_book (6), drift_book (7).
# HOW       : Same hierarchy everywhere: DASHBOARD -> SUMMARY -> DETAIL -> METHOD, with lineage and standing rules.
# VALUE     : Mode 4 was silently writing nothing through the entry point — the patch targeted a call signature that did not exist. Found by running, not reading.
