# VALUE     : Encodes two owner rules taken from the original source: sheet selection is the OWNER BAR not the tier (filtering on tier once produced 223 sheets of which NONE cleared IS>=100/OOS>=100/ROI>=20), and the explanatory ledger is PERMANENT — a sheet below contract is banner-flagged, never written silently.
